<title>INDIA: India's RBI lowers repo cut-off to 4.5 pct.</title>
<headline>India's RBI lowers repo cut-off to 4.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Monday it lowered the cut-off to 4.5 percent, from 4.9 percent, at its three-day auction of government securities.  </p>
<p>RBI said it received 92 bids for 123.62 billion rupees of which it accepted 34 for 46.30 billion rupees.</p>
<p>The weighted average cut-off was 4.3323 percent, it said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
